Suggests: wlr-randr, pavucontrol, network-manager-gnome, blueman
Description: three-square minimalist desktop session for Wayland
 Tres is an ultra-minimal desktop interface based on the Labwc Wayland
 compositor. Three small white squares provide an application menu, a
 window selector, and system applets. Windows can cover the squares and
 no taskbar or full-width panel is shown.
 .
 Installing this package adds Tres (Labwc) as an optional login session.
 Existing desktop environments remain installed.
